WEBVTT

00:08:24.739 --> 00:08:30.600
It's fairly mellow, and it's beckoning
to do bank tricks, right?

00:08:30.624 --> 00:08:33.344
But there's this other aspect
of it for wheelies,

00:08:33.368 --> 00:08:34.658
so check this out.

00:08:35.348 --> 00:08:36.858
There's a few tricks, again,

00:08:36.882 --> 00:08:39.283
how environment changes
the nature of your tricks.

00:08:39.307 --> 00:08:42.009
Freestyle oriented,
manual down -- wheelie down.

00:08:42.504 --> 00:08:45.578
Watch, this one? Oh, I love this,
it's like surfing, this one,

00:08:45.602 --> 00:08:47.156
the way you catch it.

00:08:47.180 --> 00:08:50.330
This one, a little sketchy
going backwards,

00:08:50.354 --> 00:08:51.541
and watch the back foot.

00:08:53.116 --> 00:08:54.267
Oops --

00:08:54.291 --> 00:08:55.704
(Laughter)

00:08:55.728 --> 00:08:57.228
Mental note right there.

00:08:57.252 --> 00:08:58.850
Again, we'll get back to that.

00:08:58.874 --> 00:09:00.025
(Laughter)